{"steam_appid":3364070,"steam_name":"The Jackbox Party Pack 11","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3364070/891763058/3b1b8e42f8e9c464435b4472de65f5a8bea95118/1758577215/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758579579","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204296/6f69601130d9caba1c3692d54df39ca1d325eae0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758579579","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/ec1efafdcdfc6aa9bd0c05d65de8cd9e269598fc/ss_ec1efafdcdfc6aa9bd0c05d65de8cd9e269598fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774630140","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/fb6feb4b5711491f6c6f1d56c171f0ee678f1e8b/ss_fb6feb4b5711491f6c6f1d56c171f0ee678f1e8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774630140","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/cf87f1488883baaee27d2b4b42acc255177f20a7/ss_cf87f1488883baaee27d2b4b42acc255177f20a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774630140","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/4f0f7b90a3d5da52dcdd06efe5adb395eea38200/ss_4f0f7b90a3d5da52dcdd06efe5adb395eea38200.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774630140","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/ab1fad219fcf37340fc31000fe9f7f528dfdf5f8/ss_ab1fad219fcf37340fc31000fe9f7f528dfdf5f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774630140"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/f7ea14ae170e75f56d314a340b816f4e.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Party Pack Is Back!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Jackbox Party Pack 11</i> catapults you and your crew into the best timeline of party game pandemonium. Whether you’re a trivia titan, a joke mastermind, or the resident undercover detective of your friend group, there’s something for everyone in this pack. No extra controllers needed - players simply join the game and play using phones, tablets or computers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five brand-new games</strong> will change the way you party this fall and holiday season:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/8060ff76fda8d2a34fcb6d255118689a.poster.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/8060ff76fda8d2a34fcb6d255118689a.webm?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/8060ff76fda8d2a34fcb6d255118689a.mp4?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/1132806258292cd50706d999668859b5.avif?t=1774630140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras_big/1132806258292cd50706d999668859b5.webp?t=1774630140 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Doominate</strong> (Writing)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a perfectly lovely situation and destroy it in this head-to-head joke game where it feels so good to be so bad. Doominate supports 3-8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/6843c2eae613a5a38560a13cc1cf56a3.poster.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/6843c2eae613a5a38560a13cc1cf56a3.webm?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/6843c2eae613a5a38560a13cc1cf56a3.mp4?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/13a450e2f585ead7444b1fa07dfb3e33.avif?t=1774630140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras_big/13a450e2f585ead7444b1fa07dfb3e33.webp?t=1774630140 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hear</strong> <strong>Say</strong> (Sound Effects)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Record sound effects and dialogue directly from your phone in a foley-inspired game where laughter is the soundtrack. Then, watch your voices come to life in a series of short movie clips! Hear Say supports 2-8 players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/9b6147a2b9550c799dcc0d4b51549e0e.poster.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/9b6147a2b9550c799dcc0d4b51549e0e.webm?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/9b6147a2b9550c799dcc0d4b51549e0e.mp4?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/62166285b61b612b0351aa871de71841.avif?t=1774630140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras_big/62166285b61b612b0351aa871de71841.webp?t=1774630140 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cookie</strong> <strong>Haus</strong> (Drawing)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play our coziest and kookiest drawing game yet by fulfilling cookie design orders for unusual clientele. Don’t play on an empty stomach! Cookie Haus supports 3-8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/b7d2f7b417c19fbed316663d304c9837.poster.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/b7d2f7b417c19fbed316663d304c9837.webm?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/b7d2f7b417c19fbed316663d304c9837.mp4?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/a67d6d5013f06182a0f24c53c1244f38.avif?t=1774630140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras_big/a67d6d5013f06182a0f24c53c1244f38.webp?t=1774630140 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suspectives</strong> (Social Deduction)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There’s been a crime, one player secretly did it, and the evidence comes from your own survey answers! Study the clues, defend your innocence (even if you’re lying), and put your friends on trial. Suspectives supports 4-8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/a5d28a7e6ccc987f870c2689e2885b16.poster.avif?t=1774630140\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/a5d28a7e6ccc987f870c2689e2885b16.webm?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/a5d28a7e6ccc987f870c2689e2885b16.mp4?t=1774630140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras/66b85391f7c78f747bfb81299c3502c9.avif?t=1774630140\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364070/extras_big/66b85391f7c78f747bfb81299c3502c9.webp?t=1774630140 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Legends of Trivia</strong> (Trivia)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your team and put your trivia knowledge to the test in a fantastical world full of danger! Teamwork! Monsters! Do you dare take on one of the most challenging trivia games yet? Legends of Trivia supports 1-6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re gathering with old friends, big family, or interdimensional travelers, <i>The Jackbox Party Pack 11</i> is here to bring back the ultimate house party. In this universe, fun is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.66 Ghz Core 2 Duo or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 500+ / Radeon 5000+ or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.33 GHz Quad Core or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 600+ / Radeon 6000+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Jackbox Games, Inc."],"publishers":["Jackbox Games, Inc."],"release_date":"22 Oct, 2025"}